This repository is a private planning and design record. It is deliberately
not published under an open-source licence: ninja-recorder v2 is moving
toward a capture backend that does not inherit GPL-2.0, in order to keep a
closed-source or source-available distribution possible. See
docs/decisions/0002-two-release-relicensing-sequence.md.

Nothing in this repository changes the licence of any released version of
ninja-recorder. Releases up to and including v2.0.0 are GPL-2.0 and remain
available under that licence.
